  "body": "**Summary**\r\n\r\nThis PR expands instantsearch.css to include basic default styles for `relatedProducts`.\r\n\r\nIt also updates the spec file for `frequentlyBoughtTogether` to switch from `objectID` → `objectIDs`.\r\n\r\n**Result**\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n  <summary>algolia.css</summary>\r\n  <img width=\"903\" alt=\"CleanShot 2024-04-19 at 15 24 48@2x\" src=\"https://github.com/algolia/instantsearch/assets/154633/c46785d2-4e83-449d-b6b4-fd27b03cc888\">\r\n</details>\r\n<details>\r\n  <summary>satellite.css</summary>\r\n  <img width=\"897\" alt=\"CleanShot 2024-04-19 at 15 25 06@2x\" src=\"https://github.com/algolia/instantsearch/assets/154633/9aa3d34c-59fb-451a-a05d-8be26e912608\">\r\n</details>\r\n\r\nFX-2816\r\n",
